## 3. Router Advertisements
{% if network.ipv6_mode | default("dhcpv6") == "slaac" or network.ipv6_mode | default("dhcpv6") == "both" %}

- Enable RA on LAN interface
- Set AdvAutonomous ON (A=1) for SLAAC address generation
{% if network.ipv6_mode | default("dhcpv6") == "both" %}
- Set AdvManagedFlag ON (M=1) for DHCPv6 address assignment
{% endif %}
- Set AdvOtherConfigFlag ON (O=1) for DNS/NTP via DHCPv6
{% elif network.ipv6_mode | default("dhcpv6") == "dhcpv6" %}

- Enable RA on LAN interface (required for default gateway even with DHCPv6)
- Set AdvAutonomous OFF (A=0) — disable SLAAC
- Set AdvManagedFlag ON (M=1) — use DHCPv6 for addresses
- Set AdvOtherConfigFlag ON (O=1) — use DHCPv6 for DNS/NTP
{% endif %}
{% endif %}

