| {{ ssh.port }} | TCP | SSH | Admin -> All |
{% if network.ipv6_enabled | default(true) %}

### ICMPv6 (CRITICAL)

**Never block ICMPv6 entirely.** IPv6 depends on it for:
- Neighbor Discovery (replaces ARP)
- Router Solicitation/Advertisement
- Path MTU Discovery
- Duplicate Address Detection

At minimum allow ICMPv6 types: 133 (RS), 134 (RA), 135 (NS), 136 (NA), 137 (Redirect).
